x"}, "body": "Hi sensei,\nI really like your artwork! I’d like to request an illustration of any kind\nYou can pick any of my oc, or both of them. \nSisyphus: A bard who is endlessly reincarnated, carrying fragments of his past lives in his songs and poems. He observes Flore and records her existence in his stories.\nFlore: An immortal traveler whose body is partially composed of plants—her organs resemble vines, blossoms, or roots. She can not be normally observed, and people easily forget her. \nHe wrote stories about her, and she knew him through his words in his books. \nFeel free to draw anything  you like! Personal use only. \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uFzInzOA-RIi5CSbNH-INBx0LA4zHxNZ?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Pokashi/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3863407, "client_id": 2178819, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c221547/uploads/origins/ea12f7e9-361a-45f7-8118-7f1f556b597a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e350658fb3785fae79298c2841ee242", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c221547/uploads/origins/ea12f7e9-361a-45f7-8118-7f1f556b597a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e350658fb3785fae79298c2841ee242, https://si.imgix.net/1c221547/uploads/origins/ea12f7e9-361a-45f7-8118-7f1f556b597a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=544710d95f5e133c404b58712aa17ee6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c221547/uploads/origins/ea12f7e9-361a-45f7-8118-7f1f556b597a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44119bb9211856831d78519baa6ece9b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c221547/uploads/origins/ea12f7e9-361a-45f7-8118-7f1f5